=Your WhatsApp assistant needs you (or has news).

Customer: {{ $json.customerName }} ({{ $json.customerPhone }})
Intent: {{ $json.intent }}
Status: {{ $json.status }}
Needs human: {{ $json.needsHuman }}
Booking: {{ JSON.stringify($json.booking) }}
Notes: {{ $json.notes }}

Customer said:
{{ $json.customerMessage }}

Assistant replied:
{{ $json.reply }}

Full log is in the Conversations sheet.
